Subject: [PATCH 1065/1695] dt-bindings: update YAML documentation for
 stm32mp25-rifsc

Add description of st,risal property

RISAL (Resource Isolation Slave Unit for Address Space) is part of RISC
(RIF Security Controller) which is responsible for the isolation
of hardware resources like memory or peripherals.

RISAL allow to configure LPSRAM security access.

